WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
完成普通任务所需的公共地面先连续成立；验证只在旁侧、限域、可选择的叠层中出现。
Public ground needed for the ordinary task is continuous first; verification appears only as a side, bounded, optional overlay.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:18.000
众智园是并行带与旁侧验证庭；原点社区是一街两院与四个可撤回节点；大钟寺是四向通勤十字与路外厅台。
Zhongzhiyuan uses parallel bands and a side verification garden; Origin Community uses one street, two courts, and four withdrawable nodes; Dazhongsi uses a four-way commute cross and an off-route hall and desk.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
纸面、口头、实体导视和人工路径可独立完成同一基本任务；账户、扫码、设备和 AI 都不是前提。
Paper, oral, physical-wayfinding, and staffed paths independently complete the same basic task; account, QR, device, and AI are not prerequisites.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
验证只在自愿、公告且前置条件满足的未来窗口旁置出现；普通路径不被占用，可随时退出。
Verification appears beside the route only in a future voluntary, announced window with preconditions met; the ordinary path is not occupied and exit remains available.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
故障只停止并隔离验证对象；普通生活、非 AI 同任务路径、人工交接、申诉和退出继续。
Failure stops and isolates verification objects only; ordinary life, the same-task non-AI path, staffed handoff, appeal, and exit continue.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
恢复先还原普通任务、人工服务、实体信息和可追证状态；它不等于模型重启、授权、批准或进入 G1。
Recovery first restores the ordinary task, staffed service, physical information, and traceable state; it is not model restart, authorization, approval, or G1.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
唯一 pre-G1 候选是 JZ-05 × SCENE-011 × T-02；H01—H07 的现实关闭与接受均为 0，当前仍为 G0 / NO-GO。
The sole pre-G1 candidate is JZ-05 x SCENE-011 x T-02; real closure and acceptance of H01-H07 are both 0, so the current state remains G0 / NO-GO.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
G0、NO-GO、provisional、not to scale、现实结果 0：本合同是概念表达，不构成现场、批准或官方边界证据。
G0, NO-GO, provisional, not to scale, real results 0: this contract is conceptual expression, not site, approval, or official-boundary evidence.
